{"ID":"20240205170446-yg0kd26","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205170446-yg0kd26","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170446-yg0kd26\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170625-kt7y3pz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170625-kt7y3pz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170625-kt7y3pz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"升药","type":"doc","updated":"20240830161948"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205170625-kt7y3pz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170625-kt7y3pz","updated":"20240205170625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升药"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升药-20240205170625-t4ik7e7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710144115-ltb9jxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710144115-ltb9jxb","updated":"20240710144115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升药"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升药-20240710144115-36u440x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710143902-8rddpjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710143902-8rddpjr","updated":"20240710143954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：升药为水银、火硝、白矾各等分混合升华而成。红色者称红升，黄色者称黄升。——百度百科。"}]},{"ID":"20240710143902-zbdwaau","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240710143902-zbdwaau"}},{"ID":"20240830161940-a5dgfrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-a5dgfrq","updated":"20240830161948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：升药底"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-joqaq18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-joqaq18","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"升药底《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-be1rab5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-be1rab5","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShēnɡYàoDǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-atqjsvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-atqjsvv","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】红粉底"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-rk9rgy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-rk9rgy6","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为加工升药时锅底所留的残渣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-sr40c62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-sr40c62","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】河北、北京、江苏、上海、湖北、湖南。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-jpsmcvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-jpsmcvp","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】化腐生肌。主治皮肤溃烂，压伤，碰伤，破流脓血，久不收敛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-3dk85uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-3dk85uy","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】外用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-hei2mgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-hei2mgc","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】本品有毒，均作外用，不可内服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-48qzj19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-48qzj19","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】主要原料为水银、火硝、明矾各等量或水银13两，火硝8两，明矾10两。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-omg31wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-omg31wd","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-0sdcx25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-0sdcx25","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"升药底《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-wvst01p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-wvst01p","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《药材资料汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-o8fm6dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-o8fm6dm","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShēnɡYàoDǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-cy7tce1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-cy7tce1","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为炼制升药后留在锅底的残渣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-d7jwcod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-d7jwcod","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】为不规则的板块状，多数一面平坦，一面呈蜂窝状，全体呈乳白色至淡黄色，厚约1厘米。质硬而脆。气微臭。以淡黄色、块状、纯净者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-t3jwqtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-t3jwqtr","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-aplkofg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-aplkofg","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药材资料汇编》：\"治疥癣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-rw9wkf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-rw9wkf6","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《中药志》：\"用于疥疮，能杀虫止痒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-295yf31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-295yf31","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】外用：研末调涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-hqyfesm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-hqyfesm","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-24kiky7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-24kiky7","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"升药底《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-uyo0aq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-uyo0aq9","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《药材资料汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-13qb5gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-13qb5gv","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShēnɡYàoDǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-bwcoqd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-bwcoqd5","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Residueofaftermakingmercuricoxideismadeofinasimpleandeasymethod"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-kncbcp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-kncbcp3","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】灵药渣、红粉底"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-23k4t9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-23k4t9k","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-9ne9jyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-9ne9jyq","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为炼制升药后留在锅底的残渣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-ya8tzcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-ya8tzcv","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名："}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-7g2j141","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-7g2j141","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产于河北、天津、湖北武汉、湖南湘潭、江苏镇江；其他地区亦可制造。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-jmvn6xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-jmvn6xw","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别本品为不规则厚片状，通常直径3-7cm，厚0.3-0.7cm。白色至淡黄色；条痕白色，微带黄色调。一面较平坦或具极细小也，另一面粗糙或呈蜂窝状。质硬脆，可折断，断面多数为淡黄色，有的散有红色点或线。气微臭。以厚片状、淡黄色、纯净者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-ck051y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-ck051y8","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】主要含硫酸汞(HgSO4)，硝酸汞[Hg(NO3)2]，硫酸钾(K2SO4),氧化铝(Al2O3)，亚硝酸钾(KNO2)。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-s63u1ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-s63u1ao","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；平"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-nquqrxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-nquqrxj","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-n8naqyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-n8naqyb","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】杀虫止痒；收湿生肌。主疥癣；湿疹；黄水疮"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-x9cx46c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-x9cx46c","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】外用：研末调涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-4wdwq5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-4wdwq5u","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-0izt254","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-0izt254","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《药材资料汇编》：治疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-pcndvky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-pcndvky","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《中药志》：用于疥疮，能杀虫止痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161940-kd74pf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161940-kd74pf0","updated":"20240830161947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161942-3z2rqzn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830161942-3z2rqzn","updated":"20240830161947"}},{"ID":"20240830161943-4sl56ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161943-4sl56ct","updated":"20240830161947"}}]}